    <string name="acerca_la_app">THE APP</string>
    <string name="acerca_la_app_texto">Miau Focus is a concentration app using the Pomodoro technique, so you can study without getting distracted, with a kitten keeping you company. Made with care by a small independent team.</string>
    <string name="acerca_como_hecha">HOW IT IS MADE</string>
    <string name="acerca_como_hecha_texto">A native Android app, written in Java. It asks for no internet permission, shows no ads and needs no account. All your information is stored only on your device.</string>
